Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see him with the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that he\Nhad it anywhere near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see him put in the red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be. Dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be back in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be back in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.26,0:01:23.73,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.26,0:01:23.73,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's a big space.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.35,0:01:27.56,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.35,0:01:27.56,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.56,0:01:30.94,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.56,0:01:30.94,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:01:30.94,0:01:38.20,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.94,0:01:38.20,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
