Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.95,0:01:44.75,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.95,0:01:44.75,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.95,0:01:44.75,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.75,0:01:53.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.75,0:01:53.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.28,0:01:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.46,0:01:59.55,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.46,0:01:59.55,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.35,0:02:06.18,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.35,0:02:06.18,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.18,0:02:10.02,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.18,0:02:10.02,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.02,0:02:15.44,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.02,0:02:15.44,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.28,0:02:18.53,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.28,0:02:18.53,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.53,0:02:20.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.53,0:02:20.78,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.53,0:02:20.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.53,0:02:20.78,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.62,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.62,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who won't\Nhit I don't even know?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.62,0:02:30.42,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.62,0:02:30.42,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.42,0:02:35.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.42,0:02:35.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.51,0:02:45.26,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1250,865)\fscx77\blur1}Episode 25: "The Birth of a Superbeing!!" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 24 -Fadeout4} {If this episode title gets changed, let me know. I squished the font a bit to make room for it since it's a bit long and was cut off on the right -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.51,0:02:45.26,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1250,865)\fscx(90)}Episode 25: "Birth of the Ultimate Being" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 24 -Fadeout4} {If this episode title gets changed, let me know. I squished the font a bit to make room for it since it's a bit long and was cut off on the right -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who won the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll stand up again, Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the fatherland's cream of the crop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will stand your ground no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has become the uber-mensch! Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought no creature could\Nattain perfection, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How his arm is burning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we don't have to\Nfight perfection after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmon melts his accursed flesh even now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In another minute, there\Nwill be nothing left of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has lusted after the\NRed Stone for millennia,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when it is all said and done,\Nhis quest for immortality has failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will perish knowing\Nthat you are a failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready the UV amplifier for another shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One direct hit should be\Nenough to finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it up, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staring at a damn squirrel. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Mr. Speedwagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hand, it's changing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen some crazy stuff, but this...
