Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know the guy it's made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
