Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has complete mastery over organic life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is rising!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a one of them left alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars is about to get what's coming to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's feeling fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's standing in the morning sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he couldn't care less about it!
