Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a horrible\Nnightmare! We're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the day all of us die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humanity's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alpha and Omega both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the pinnacle of all life\Nthat has ever trod the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of their forms are mine to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, my old nemesis, I\Nsee how entrancing you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours is a beauty the likes\Nof which I have never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:07:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I once feared you, but\Nnow I fear you no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars, he's become invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has no weaknesses now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even shrugs off\NHamon like it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's won, and he knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see it in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars the pillar man is no more!
