Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.60,0:07:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who hit him with the UV\Nafter he put on the completed mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is there really no way to stop him, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so strong now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna be food for\Nthis walking museum piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I've got a plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear you right, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last all-or-nothing gambit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All-or-nothing gambit, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's my final move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it involve?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, when you say final move, you're not\Nreferring to that final move, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is something you're going\Nto have to do for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what to do and\NI'll follow your lead, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I knew you were gonna do that!
