Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a historic moment, and\NAbbacchio and Akira must be avenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall celebrate my rebirth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the utter eradication\Nof Joseph Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gaining on us! Not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I going to think of\Nsomething with you carrying on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've still got our dignity, Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo's out there risking life and limb\Nto lead cars away from us. Good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, it is only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This foe ain't one you\Ncan beat! He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna think\Nof something, do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you running with me, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you haven't\Nnoticed this yet, Smokey,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm the one who's got Kars\Nreally banked out of shape, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are good friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll take it really badly\Nif you die because of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.02,0:09:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the moment, at least,\NKars is after my blood alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks that killing means a\Ngood way to wring in his new life,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means that monster's\Nnot going to stop chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until I've drawn my final breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, there's something\Nyou really need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa, Lisa, she's more than just\Nsome humble master. She's your...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit flapping, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has that pillar man really\Nbecome a perfect being?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, our greatest fear has been realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in front of us, Kars has become\Nan unstoppable force of nature!
