Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no way to stop him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has no weaknesses at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans can't kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even Hamon or the sun itself\Nwill do a lick of good against him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're gonna\Nhave to tell me later! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda short on time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one with wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of our German warplanes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars mutates his feathers into\Nplated projectiles as hard as
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,armadillo shells and coats them\Nwith a bullet deflecting oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, their toughness makes\Nthem ideal not only as shielding,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as weapons in their own right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting those feathers\Nat me is dirty pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Touching down is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to make my getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long can he last when\Nall he can do is run for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fly, boy, and don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all we humans can do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try to save our skins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,240 kilometers an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how perfect\Nthat bastard may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This plane has got more horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he has any morning plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd better cancel them because\NI'm in this for the long haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:13:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I can't give him the slip\Nfor as long as I had thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cretin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That metal coffin of yours will\Nonly protect you for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your plan involves landing\Nsomewhere, I've got news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way you'll return to\NTerra Firma is in bloody chunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo! Jojo! Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Speedwagon over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys missing me down there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you were smart to grab that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's not much, but the Germans and\NI will do what we can to help from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a map?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maintain radio contact, and\NI'll guide you to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jackpot. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, give us your current position.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:14:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you're breaking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me, for\Nthe love of God, pipe up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, clear as a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think this is gonna go? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't have a weapon or fighting\Ntechnique that'll work on cars worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were yelling about him\Nbeing immortal, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You running away isn't ideal,\Nbut it's all you can really do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking over this map gave me an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jojo, don't face Kars alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to act a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be too strong later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the only time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to get\Nyourself killed out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just listen for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Kars is the most powerful\Ncreature on Earth at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he was born here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thousands of years ago,\Nthis planet gave him life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we're lucky, it'll\Ntake that life right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:15:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.22,0:16:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world do you think\Nwill be a threat to cars? Magma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, magma's the\Nhottest substance on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drive him into the\Nlava at Isola di Vulcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even he can't survive that! No! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've risked your neck for\Nhumanity more than enough, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me and the Germans do\Nthe heavy lifting for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to him, Jojo! Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars is gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but I'm at the\Nvolcano, so it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.60,0:16:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grip diem, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, God, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Joestar, his son\NJonathan, and his son George.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The men of the Joestar family\Nwere all cut down far too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:17:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again. Why do they\Nalways have their lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taken don't fly into\Nthat volcano survive for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa's sake, listen to\Nme. Lisa Lisa is your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your mother what did you\Nsay you're breaking up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
