Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piranhas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's logical!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll eat the plane\Nright out from under me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.64,0:17:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how'd they get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those feathers Coz shot before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They turned into these damn things!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggeroll, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat the parachute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You devil fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:17:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you even hear me? Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that parachute is your salvation,\Nbut all it does is seal your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a butterfly\Ncaught in a spider's web.
