Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if this is a decoy... Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't go down without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I have got a\Ndate with that volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to weasel out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joosho!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny Iran, a long time ago,\Nyou told me about my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said he died on the Atlantic to save\Nyou and father from his greatest foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I don't mean to be a copycat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the hand my blood dealt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I can pry\Nmyself from this foul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,contraption before you try\Nto smash it into the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you gibbering primate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that your death\Nwon't accomplish anything!
