Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame all of your\Nscheming and still you die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you get into the plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you have time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.10,0:20:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure you could\Nhandle this battle. All alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time I should stow away in the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proper next time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump out, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on your life! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, piranhas\Nate my damn parachute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to die, jump\Nout of there this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.38,0:20:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell a bad joke, or call me an old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me hear your voice\None more time! I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroheim, you're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm crazy too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit when someone's got me beat...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty courageous move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about Vertigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me cars fell into the lava.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.86,0:22:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.\NThe words will make
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.09,0:22:09.59,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.59,0:22:13.14,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You out and out. You'll\Nspend the day your way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.14,0:22:18.40,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,We spend the day your way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.40,0:22:20.98,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling morning, running through\Nthe sun. And in and out the valley
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.98,0:22:24.73,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley... hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.73,0:22:27.15,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minds come out of the\Nsky. They stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.41,0:22:30.45,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.45,0:22:32.37,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over. We'll be\Nthere. We'll see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.45,0:22:39.12,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two samples. We'll be\Nthere. You'll be too.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.75,0:22:45.30,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.92,0:22:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four. We'll see you.\NI'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.09,0:22:51.76,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.76,0:22:55.72,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.76,0:22:55.72,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,there with you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.47,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\pos(960,700)\bord5.5\blur2}Next Episode
