Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say harm on overdrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's laughing now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To purge your fears and\Nreign forever as God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, goodbye.
